3GPP / ETSI specifications
--------------------------
Numeric test parameters, reference measurement channel names, and related
lookup tables in this repository are derived from 3GPP Technical
Specifications, in particular 3GPP TS 38.181 (ETSI TS 138 181) and
3GPP TS 36.181 (ETSI TS 136 181). Those specifications are copyright of the
3GPP Organizational Partners / ETSI.

This repository does not include copies of the specification documents.
The lookup tables are an independent implementation of selected requirement
values used to configure Rohde & Schwarz signal generators.

Users must verify all values against the official ETSI/3GPP publication that
applies to their test. 3GPP TS/TR documents have no legal status for product
conformance; use the corresponding Organizational Partner publication
(for example ETSI TS 138 181 or ETSI TS 136 181).

